<title>ESTONIA: HANSAPANK INSURANCE IN 2.7 MLN KROON H1 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK INSURANCE IN 2.7 MLN KROON H1 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank Insurance had a net profit of 2.7 million kroons in the first six months of 1997, Hansapank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company's total assets rose by 7.8 percent during the period, amounting to 24.7 million kroons, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>During the first half of the year, it collected 1.9 million kroons in premiums. Some 0.2 million kroons was paid out in compensations.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
